# Windows patch series for mpv, applied after series.common. Entries are staged
# into the mpv-winbuild-cmake checkout and applied with `git apply` by the
# injected PATCH_COMMAND (see platforms/windows/pin_packages.py).
# Every group but android: a MediaCodec that starts failing mid-stream rarely
# recovers, and waiting out its error burst only delays the software fallback.
0025-vd-lavc-recover-hwdec-after-decode-error-burst.patch
0143-desktop-plezy-motion-engine-filter.patch
0146-desktop-pme-count-worker-dispatch-in-deadline.patch
0148-desktop-pme-select-vulkan-device.patch
0149-desktop-pme-meson-target-arguments.patch
0150-desktop-pme-stage-timing-metadata.patch
0151-desktop-pme-prefer-cached-host-memory.patch
0152-desktop-pme-support-reduced-model-shapes.patch
0154-desktop-pme-overlap-scheduler.patch
